      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-23910-24551"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-23913-23928"><rb>第</rb><rt>だい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-23928-23934">三の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-23934-23955"><rb>動機</rb><rt>どうき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-23955-23961">は、</seg><hi rend="bouten 丸傍点 right" source="#source-23961-24018" corresp="#source-23976-24018"><seg source="#source-23961-23976">科學の進歩</seg></hi><seg source="#source-24018-24030">である。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24030-24051"><rb>地震</rb><rt>ぢしん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24051-24054">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24054-24072"><rb>如何</rb><rt>いか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24072-24078">なる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24078-24102"><rb>有樣</rb><rt>ありさま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24102-24105">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24105-24120"><rb>於</rb><rt>おい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24120-24123">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24123-24144"><rb>家屋</rb><rt>かをく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24144-24147">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24147-24171"><rb>震盪</rb><rt>しんたう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24171-24177">し、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24177-24204"><rb>潰倒</rb><rt>くわいたう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24204-24216">するかを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24216-24243"><rb>觀察</rb><rt>くわんさつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24243-24246">し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24246-24270"><rb>破壞</rb><rt>はくわい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24270-24276">した</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24276-24297"><rb>家屋</rb><rt>かおく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24297-24315">についてその</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24315-24339"><rb>禍根</rb><rt>くわこん</rt></rub